    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Main decoder matrix coverage is verified against the checkpoint index and sampled Safetensors headers. The storage profile uses E4M3FN with one FP32 inverse scale per 128 × 128 block. Key and value projections retain complete blocks when separated in the absorbed MLA graph. Experts only read the locally touched fraction of weights and scales. Matrix execution uses the BF16 analytical baseline. KV, routing and other non-FP8 tensors retain their declared formats."
    }
